			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>depend upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα τῆς Φωκέων σωτηρίας ἐπὶ τὴν
