				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα γ᾽ εἰς βούλησιν ἥκειν τὴν ἐμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					4.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> c.
			inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧκέ μοι γένει . .
				πενθεῖν</span>
